DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42177::$$$message_0329_0000_0000$$$::"According to the invitation, there is a hot spring resort nearby..."::
42178::$$$message_0329_0000_0001$$$::"...?[lr]::
42179::$$$message_0329_0000_0002$$$::Sella, something's wrong.[lr]::
42180::$$$message_0329_0000_0003$$$::There's a magical power that feels like Illyaaa[line len=2]"[nolr]::
42181::$$$message_0329_0000_0004$$$::"Hehe. Looking for something, beautiful ladies?[lr]::
42182::$$$message_0329_0000_0005$$$::Also, I have a stomachache."::
42183::$$$message_0329_0000_0006$$$::"Who goes there!?"::
42184::$$$message_0329_0000_0007$$$::"...Oh, if it isn't the son of the Makiri."::
42185::$$$message_0329_0001_0000$$$::"We are in a hurry, with neither the time nor inclination to play with you."::
42186::$$$message_0329_0001_0001$$$::"Yeah. We gotta get to the onsen."::
42187::$$$message_0329_0001_0002$$$::"Hahaha. The first thing you mention is an onsen?"[lr]::
42188::$$$message_0329_0001_0003$$$::"So, let me get this straight.[lr]::
42189::$$$message_0329_0001_0004$$$::Are you a couple of idiots dressed up as maids?[lr]::
42190::$$$message_0329_0001_0005$$$::Or are you trying to open a maid-themed onsen resort in the middle of nowhere?"::
42191::$$$message_0329_0001_0006$$$::"Ahh, I can't take it, my stomach hurts from laughing so hard! There's no hot springs in these gloomy mountains!"::
42192::$$$message_0329_0002_0000$$$::"You're getting scammed, [hfchance layer=0]just like me!"::
42193::$$$message_0329_0002_0001$$$::"...Sella. Can I crush it?"::
42194::$$$message_0329_0002_0002$$$::"Just a moment.[lr]::
42195::$$$message_0329_0002_0003$$$::...Lazy son of the Makiri. What do you mean, we're being scammed?"::
42196::$$$message_0329_0002_0004$$$::"I just said there aren't any onsen here!"::
42197::$$$message_0329_0002_0005$$$::"Dammit, this free night's stay is a load of crap! There's no harem no matter where I look!"::
42198::$$$message_0329_0002_0006$$$::"Argh, my sides hurt so bad! The tummyache is killing me![lr]::
42199::$$$message_0329_0002_0007$$$::I'm lost! I wanna go home!"::
42200::$$$message_0329_0002_0008$$$::"...Leysritt."::
42201::$$$message_0329_0002_0009$$$::"Yeah. Big punishment time."::

